{
  "Name": "Christmas_Miller",
  "$Comment": [
    "Tomas the Miller's Christmas conversation, what he says once only Christmas runs and he stands beside",
    "Santa in his winter clothes (his placement's Christmas entry names it in Interact). While Harvest",
    "Feast's last days still run he speaks his feast conversation instead, whose Christmas lines reach his",
    "stall and his quest list (DialogueExtensions/SeasonsOfOrbis/Christmas_Miller_Feast_Line.json). Tomas",
    "contracts everything: I've, it's, don't.",
    "",
    "Start's First beats come first. The off-season beat answers a visit while Christmas is off (after a",
    "command ends it, or when a server owner stands Tomas somewhere all year) with one line and goodbye. A",
    "conversation has no Season leaf, so the off-season beat and the stall line read the feature",
    "ziggfreedcommon:feature Christmas_Live, Min 1, and nobody is sent to a stall that opens closed. Then",
    "the next step's pointer, once per player (OnceId christmas_tomas_next_elsie): once his part of the",
    "story is collected and Elsie's is not taken yet, he sends the player to her. Collecting his quest plays",
    "this conversation again (its CompletionDialogue), so the pointer comes straight after.",
    "",
    "Quests holds three rows, all bound to him by the id he keeps in both seasons (Harvest_Feast_Miller).",
    "His part of Santa's story, Christmas Cookies (christmas_gingerbread_cookies): the conversation opens on",
    "its offer while it can be taken, on its brief while it is carried, and on its hand-in once the cookie",
    "is in the bag. Then his daily, Daily Baking (christmas_daily_baking), the same three screens. Then his",
    "secret's apprentice quest, Tomas's Apprentice (christmas_tomas_apprentice), the same three screens: it",
    "teaches the route that opens his loaf recipe on every server. Each hand-in opens his quest list with",
    "Collect in front of the player. Otherwise it opens on greeting, the Fallback: who he is this Christmas",
    "and what his stall sells, in plain words, with his stall, his quest list (Any work for me?, which also",
    "lists the day's job from his own board, Boards/SeasonsOfOrbis/Christmas_Miller_Jobs.json), how to make",
    "dough (the dough screen), and why he is here. One more line shows only where MMO Skill Tree is installed",
    "(its Factor condition, hytale:mod_installed with Min 1): the other key to his secret, Crafting level 20,",
    "on the secret_skill screen. Its words, and the apprentice quest's, are in christmas.mmo.lang."
  ],
  "Start": {
    "First": [
      {
        "Node": "off_season",
        "When": [
          { "Type": "Not", "Of": [ { "Type": "Factor", "Factor": "ziggfreedcommon:feature", "Param": "Christmas_Live", "Min": 1 } ] }
        ]
      },
      {
        "Node": "next_elsie",
        "When": [
          { "Type": "QuestState", "Quest": "christmas_gingerbread_cookies", "State": "COMPLETED" },
          { "Type": "QuestState", "Quest": "christmas_wrapping_presents", "State": "NOT_STARTED" }
        ],
        "Once": true,
        "OnceId": "christmas_tomas_next_elsie"
      }
    ],
    "Quests": {
      "christmas_gingerbread_cookies": { "Offerable": "cookies_offer", "Active": "cookies_brief", "Ready": "cookies_ready" },
      "christmas_daily_baking": { "Offerable": "baking_offer", "Active": "baking_brief", "Ready": "baking_ready" },
      "christmas_tomas_apprentice": { "Offerable": "apprentice_offer", "Active": "apprentice_brief", "Ready": "apprentice_ready" }
    },
    "Fallback": "greeting"
  },
  "Nodes": {
    "off_season": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_miller.off_season.text",
      "Options": [
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_miller.off_season.opt.farewell", "Style": "farewell", "Close": true }
      ]
    },
    "greeting": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_miller.greeting.text",
      "Options": [
        {
          "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_miller.opt.stall",
          "Style": "neutral",
          "Conditions": [
            { "Type": "Factor", "Factor": "ziggfreedcommon:feature", "Param": "Christmas_Live", "Min": 1 }
          ],
          "Open": { "Type": "Shop", "Shop": "Christmas_Miller" }
        },
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_miller.opt.quests", "Style": "neutral", "Open": "Quests" },
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_miller.opt.dough", "Style": "neutral", "Goto": "dough" },
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_miller.opt.why", "Style": "neutral", "Goto": "why" },
        {
          "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_miller.opt.secret_skill",
          "Style": "neutral",
          "Conditions": [
            { "Type": "Factor", "Factor": "hytale:mod_installed", "Param": "Ziggfreed:MMOSkillTree", "Min": 1 }
          ],
          "Goto": "secret_skill"
        }
      ],
      "IncludeOptions": [ "goodbye" ]
    },
    "secret_skill": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_miller.secret_skill.text",
      "Options": [
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_miller.opt.back", "Style": "neutral", "Goto": "greeting" }
      ],
      "IncludeOptions": [ "goodbye" ]
    },
